  "note": "Stessmann's 1934 Plateau solution for one of the six Schoenflies quadrilaterals whose edge rotations generate a discrete group (Schwarz had solved the three most symmetric cases); extending it gives a triply periodic, non-embedded surface that Alan Schoen observed is the conjugate of his I-WP surface, predating it by 40 years."
 },
